Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["8. Top-quark angular maps: nu = 1, phi3 = 0", 
    "Section", CellTags -> "TopAngleMaps-section"], 
   Cell["At fixed nu=1 and phi3=0, set x=cos(theta1), y=cos(theta3), with \
theta1,theta3 in [0,Pi]. The five coefficients are computed once with the \
original coefficientValuesTop function. The complex angular coefficient is \
Ct=A1+A2(x^2+y^2)+A3 x^2 y^2+4B x y sqrt(1-x^2) sqrt(1-y^2)+D(1-x^2)(1-y^2). \
First evaluate the preceding coefficient definitions when recalculating this \
section. The evaluated maps and all plotting code are saved below.", "Text"], 
   Cell["The complex coefficient is evaluated on a 201-by-201 grid before \
taking its magnitude or phase. Each raw row has the form {x,y,Ct}. \
mapMagnitudeData stores the absolute magnitude; only its plotting copy is \
multiplied by 10^6, as stated on the color bar. mapPhaseData stores the \
principal phase in radians. No amplitude normalization is applied.", "Text"], 
   Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"BeginPackage", "[", "\"TopQuarkAngleMaps`\"", "]", 
       ";", " ", "Begin", "[", "\"`Private`\"", "]", ";", " ", "ClearAll", 
       "[", "\"TopQuarkAngleMaps`Private`*\"", "]", ";"}]], "Input", 
    CellTags -> "TopAngleMaps-setup-input", ShowCellLabel -> False], 
   Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"mapNu", " ", "=", " ", "1", ";", 
          " ", "mapPhi3", " ", "=", " ", "0", ";", " ", "mapPrecision", " ", 
          "=", " ", "60", ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "mapCoefficients", " ", 
          "=", " ", "TopQuarkSignal`coefficientValuesTop", "[", "mapNu", ",", 
          " ", "mapPrecision", "]", ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "mapCosGrid", 
          " ", "=", " ", "Range", "[", "-", "1", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", 
          "1", "/", "100", "]", ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
          "mapAngularBasis", "[", "x_", ",", " ", "y_", "]", " ", ":=", " ", 
          "{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", " ", "1", ",", " ", "x", "^", "2", " ", 
          "+", " ", "y", "^", "2", ",", " ", "x", "^", "2", " ", "y", "^", 
          "2", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", " ", "4", " ", "x", " ", "y", " ", 
          "Sqrt", "[", "1", "-", "x", "^", "2", "]", " ", "Sqrt", "[", "1", 
          "-", "y", "^", "2", "]", " ", "Cos", "[", "mapPhi3", "]", ",", 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", " ", "(", "1", "-", "x", "^", "2", ")", "(", 
          "1", "-", "y", "^", "2", ")", " ", "Cos", "[", "2", " ", "mapPhi3", 
