Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Explicit finite coefficients for Appendices B.2 and B.3", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"d10e94ab-0d2f-7b4e-bdfa-9991dab461da"],

Cell["\<\
The finite SK sum reduces to one ordinary 3F2(1). The two P coefficients \
below include the current V normalization and the k12 phase convention. Their \
five angular coefficients are simplified after substitution. Numerical \
regulator checks above remain separate from a symbolic proof of the \
finite-part limit.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"adf59c05-79d2-0541-ad7c-eac13456d00a"],

