Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["A.1. Assemble Eq. (146), including every r derivative", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"08c2c203-d7d7-4f37-bf20-82963bb8af0b"],

Cell["\<\
kOpp and kSame reproduce the seed normalization in the PDF. ks is an inert \
seed at general r. Differentiate H0 before setting r=1: the derivative acts \
on r^(-3-p-q), on (a\[PlusMinus]r)/r, and on ks. Only the last derivative is \
replaced using Eq. (145).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"17476882-2d8a-4c6c-8e3e-1ec40d8630b7"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"kOpp", "[", "a_", ",", " ", "p_", ",", " ", "q_", ",", " ", "v_", ",",
