Cell["\<\
The two master coefficients have opposite signs. Consequently both P1 and P2 \
contain only cm_i times the common combination Mdel=2^(2u)(O_minus \
F_minus-O_plus F_plus), plus the opposite-sign/homogeneous seeds and the \
certificate boundaries. The next saved output contains the four full rational \
certificates; the long output group may be opened for inspection.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8e73ebba-3049-4963-9b13-606d84699215"],

